From 50a5a3693124991938387c7a75a8cec6ad7bd583 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 22:32:23 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] reaper v1.4.7: UI polish + idle auto-logout (both variants)

UI/navigation only; no underlying feature change (rmcpd/rtrafd untouched).

Idle auto-logout (15 min) - reaper_shell.asp + Main_ReaperDash.asp:
- The two top-level reaper pages run a client-side idle timer; activity in the
  shell chrome AND inside the framed page (re-attached on each iframe load) resets
  it, and 15 min idle redirects to /Logout.asp. auth_check lives in the closed
  web_hook.o and a per-request timestamp would be defeated by the UI's background
  polling, so client-side idle detection is the correct lever.

Traffic Analyzer reading line (Reaper_Traffic.asp):
- setPill() reflects the SELECTED window label (Live / 24 hours / 14 days / 1 year /
  By month) + the store, updated on window switch and each live poll (was hardcoded
  'Live - <store>').

Scroll-to-top (reaper_shell.asp):
- window.scrollTo(0,0) in the iframe load handler so every framed page lands at the
  top with the tab strip visible.

Network Map USB tile (reaper_content.css):
- Glyph centered (background-position:0px -10px, glyph-only, ring untouched);
  #diskquota hidden; deviceText size reduced so a long disk name fits. Stock
  index.asp stays pristine (all via CSS).

AiMesh backdrop (reaper_content.css + www/images/ASUSLogo.png):
- .translucent_bg location photo (Home.jpg) -> shipped ASUS logo, contain, section 11.

Both v1.4.7 images built + verified (noMCP zero-trace clean). Device-icon red theme
across the client-list pages confirmed already complete on metal (v1.4.5).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
